    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">our inability to generate revenue from acquired company&#8217;s technologies or products sufficient to meet our objectives in undertaking the acquisition or even to offset the associated acquisition and maintenance costs; and</span></td></tr>
