</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">The company is advancing
a core clinical pipeline consisting of seven (7) approved Phase 2a human clinical trials, which are expected to commence patient
