director of Green Fields Capital Ltd., a public company listed on the TASE, engaged in investments in renewable energies. Mr. Rabinovich
also served until 2014, on the board of directors of Pilat Media Global PLC, a public company listed on TASE and on the Alternative Investment
Market of the London Stock Exchange. Mr. Rabinovich holds a B.A. degree in economics and accounting from the University of Haifa, Israel.</p><div>

