    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">A financial liability imposed on the office holder&#8217;s for all victims of the violation in an Administrative Proceeding.</span></td></tr>
  </table><div>
</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.1in; text-indent: -0.1in">&#160;</p><div>

</div><table cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px;">
