    <td style="width: 48px"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">a.</span></td>
    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Xtepo is a private company established in Israel on November 9, 2009. In August 2010, a share exchange transaction was completed between Xtepo and the Company.</span></td></tr>
