<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 1.25in; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 1.25in; text-align: justify">On August 14, 2024, the Company
completed the acquisition of <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c71" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:ProportionOfOwnershipInterestInSubsidiary" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-21514">100</ix:nonFraction>% of the shares of Social Proxy. As part of the acquisition, the Company recognized intangible
assets in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c48" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:IntangibleAssetsOtherThanGoodwill" scale="3" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-21515">3,601</ix:nonFraction> thousand. See also Note 5 . Effective January 1, 2025, Social Proxy was classified as a discontinued
operation, and accordingly, the intangible assets attributable to Social Proxy (Technology, Customer List and Brand) are no longer
