hese increases is <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c119" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xtlb:OptionsReserve" scale="6" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-21620">30</ix:nonFraction> million. As of December 31, 2025, the remaining number of options available for grant under the 2011 Plan is <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c2" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xtlb:RemainingNumberOfOptionsAvailableForGrant" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-21621">7,112,000</ix:nonFraction> options.</span></td></tr> </table>
